<div class="section prose">
  <p class="eyebrow">Account</p>
  <h1>You're browsing as a guest</h1>
  <p>
    Bibo doesn't have full accounts yet. Your cart and wishlist are saved for this browser
    session, so you won't lose them while you shop. Checkout works as a guest: after paying,
    your order confirmation is a link, not something tied to an account, so save it if you
    want to find it again.
  </p>
  <p>
    Sign in, saved addresses and order history are not part of this demo.
  </p>

  <div class="button-row">
    <%= link_to "View your cart", cart_path, class: "button button--secondary" %>
    <%= link_to "View your wishlist", wishlist_path, class: "button button--secondary" %>
  </div>
</div>
